              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 40.34-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaaloleeni arti jirtu ch'ufti, ato fulla heddu qoodamtele, nami ufi inqulqulleesini injiru. Ammalle sirbituni worra Lawi — Asafu, Hemani, Yeduthuni, ammalle nami balbala gosa worraleeni — woya boofta naqata. Worri Lawi ka bilbilafi kiraari harkaa qabu, d'aatu waan sorio irati baasani gama ilaboru ejaanja, ammalle worra woliini qaalole d'ibbafi diddama, ta magalata d'ooftuti jira. Worri sirbufi ka magalatafi bilbilafi waan d'ibi d'auleeni qonqo takaani sirbe AABBO Waaqa faarse waan jed'e: AABBO Waaqa faarsa, inni waan dansa, jaalalti isaaleeni haga jiru jireenna jirti. Ato qaaloleeni Mana Waaqa keesaa bau jirtu, maro tokotu duumansi bibiliqu, ka aka AABBO Waaqi arti jiru garsiisu, Mana guute, qaaloleeni huji eeba tolchu dad'abde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11+2CH.5.12+2CH.5.13+2CH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11",
              "2CH.5.12",
              "2CH.5.13",
              "2CH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
